OL,3,GNEWSAFire safety fears prompt HMO
OL,4,Areview
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 20 houses in multiple
OL,7,Foccupancy (HMOs) are being reviewed
OL,8,Famid fears over fire safety.
OL,10,FCity of Durham Parish Council said it
OL,11,Fhad analysed planning and licensing
OL,12,Fdata from the last year and discovered
OL,13,Fpotential failings including bedrooms
OL,14,Fopening directly on to kitchens and
OL,15,Fmissing fire doors in 21 properties.
OL,17,FParish councillor Roger Cornwell said:
OL,18,F"Our investigation has found repeated
OL,19,Fwarning signs."
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
