OL,3,GNEWSAFire safety fears prompt HMO
OL,4,Areview
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe findings have been passed to Durham
OL,7,FCounty Council, which has agreed to
OL,8,Freview the claims but warned the
OL,9,Finformation came from "public records
OL,10,F[that] may not reflect the current
OL,11,Flayout, occupation, or condition of a
OL,12,Fproperty."
